IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `kr-ai-domain`
IMPORT `kr-ai-operator`

-- Korea: Framework Act on the Development of Artificial Intelligence and
-- Establishment of Trust, with its Enforcement Decree -- THE BASELINE: the AI
-- business operator's questions.
-- A DRAFT. Not for use as advice. No domain expert and no lawyer qualified in
-- Korea has read this encoding against the source.
--
-- SEAT: an AI business operator (인공지능사업자, Act Art 2(7)). Every question
-- takes plain inputs, one per fact the operator can state, and builds the
-- records the rules expect in its WHERE; no rule is restated here.
-- The answers are those of the Act and the Decree as consolidated on law.go.kr
-- on 2026-10-24 (Act: in force 2026-07-21; Decree: in force 2026-08-20). The
-- provisions these questions read have not changed since the Act and the Decree
-- took effect on 2026-01-22 (NOTES.md, "Sources and edition").
-- Money is in Korean won (not 만원). Compute is a count of floating-point
-- operations, written out in full (10^26 is 100000000000000000000000000).

§ `Does the Framework Act bind me?`

@export Am I an "AI business operator" (인공지능사업자) under Article 2(7) of Korea's AI Framework Act? Every duty in the Act that this encoding covers is addressed to AI business operators.
GIVEN `my business is related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you carry on a business related to the AI industry (developing, making, producing or distributing AI products, or providing AI services)?
      `I develop AI and provide it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop AI and provide it (an AI development operator, Article 2(7)(가))?
      `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you provide AI products or AI services using AI that a developer provided (an AI utilization operator, Article 2(7)(나))?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Am I an AI business operator` `my business is related to the AI industry` `I develop AI and provide it` `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` MEANS
    `Article 2(7): an AI business operator` `me`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS `my business is related to the AI industry`
            `develops AI and provides it` IS `I develop AI and provide it`
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI`
            -- Placeholders: Article 2(7) does not read these fields.
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS FALSE
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS FALSE
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS FALSE

@export Does Korea's AI Framework Act reach my conduct? Article 4(1) applies the Act to conduct abroad that affects the Korean market or users in Korea; Article 4(2) and Decree Article 2 exclude AI developed and used only for listed defence or national-security tasks.
GIVEN `I act in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct (developing, providing or using the AI) take place in Korea?
      `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct, wherever it takes place, affect the Korean market or users in Korea?
      `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI developed and used only to perform tasks listed in Decree Article 2 (defence networks and weapons systems designated by the Minister of National Defense; listed security tasks designated by the Director of the National Intelligence Service)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Does the Act reach my conduct` `I act in Korea` `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` MEANS
    `Article 4: the Act reaches the conduct` `me`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS `I act in Korea`
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea`
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks`
            -- Placeholders: Article 4 does not read these fields.
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS FALSE
            `develops AI and provides it` IS FALSE
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS FALSE
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE

§ `The safety obligation for high-performance AI (Article 32)`

@export Does the safety obligation in Article 32 of Korea's AI Framework Act apply to my AI system, and what must I do? Decree Article 24(1) sets three criteria that must all be met: cumulative training compute of at least 10^26 floating-point operations, the most advanced AI technology now in use, and a risk of broad and serious effect on life, physical safety and fundamental rights. The Act states no period for submitting the results; the answer's period is "nothing stated".
GIVEN `my business is related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you carry on a business related to the AI industry?
      `I develop AI and provide it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop AI and provide it?
      `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you provide AI products or AI services using AI that a developer provided?
      `I act in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct take place in Korea?
      `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct, wherever it takes place, affect the Korean market or users in Korea?
      `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI developed and used only for tasks listed in Decree Article 2 (defence and national security)?
      `training compute in floating-point operations` IS A NUMBER @desc How many floating-point operations, cumulatively, were used to train the AI system? Write the whole number: 10^26 is 100000000000000000000000000. The threshold is "at least" 10^26. No official counting method has been notified (Decree Article 24(2)); give your own count.
      `it uses the most advanced AI technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Considering the state of AI technology, is the system built and run with the most advanced (최첨단) AI technology now used in AI systems?
      `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Could the system's risk have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights?
GIVETH A `Safety obligation answer`
`Does the Article 32 safety obligation apply to my AI system` `my business is related to the AI industry` `I develop AI and provide it` `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` `I act in Korea` `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` `training compute in floating-point operations` `it uses the most advanced AI technology` `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights` MEANS
    `Article 32: the safety obligation for the system` `me` `my system`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS `my business is related to the AI industry`
            `develops AI and provides it` IS `I develop AI and provide it`
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI`
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS `I act in Korea`
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea`
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks`
            -- Placeholder: Article 32 does not read this field.
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
        `my system` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
            `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS `training compute in floating-point operations`
            `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS `it uses the most advanced AI technology`
            `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights`

§ `Reporting a serious AI incident`

@export Must I report a serious AI incident under Korea's AI Framework Act or its Enforcement Decree, and if so to whom and within how many days? Answers from the text in force on 2026-10-24: no provision of the Act or the Decree requires an operator to report an incident, so there is no recipient and no period. The answer also names the nearest duty: for a system Article 32 binds, a risk-management system that monitors and responds to safety incidents, and submitting the results of the Article 32 measures to the Minister of Science and ICT.
GIVEN `my business is related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you carry on a business related to the AI industry?
      `I develop AI and provide it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop AI and provide it?
      `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you provide AI products or AI services using AI that a developer provided?
      `I act in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct take place in Korea?
      `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct, wherever it takes place, affect the Korean market or users in Korea?
      `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI developed and used only for tasks listed in Decree Article 2 (defence and national security)?
      `training compute in floating-point operations` IS A NUMBER @desc How many floating-point operations, cumulatively, were used to train the AI system involved? Write the whole number: 10^26 is 100000000000000000000000000.
      `it uses the most advanced AI technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the system built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems?
      `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Could the system's risk have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights?
GIVETH AN `Incident reporting answer`
`Must I report a serious AI incident` `my business is related to the AI industry` `I develop AI and provide it` `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` `I act in Korea` `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` `training compute in floating-point operations` `it uses the most advanced AI technology` `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights` MEANS
    `must the operator report an AI incident` `me` `my system`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS `my business is related to the AI industry`
            `develops AI and provides it` IS `I develop AI and provide it`
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI`
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS `I act in Korea`
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea`
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks`
            -- Placeholder: the reporting answer does not read this field.
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
        `my system` MEANS `The AI system` WITH
            `cumulative compute used in training, in floating-point operations` IS `training compute in floating-point operations`
            `is built and run with the most advanced AI technology now used in AI systems` IS `it uses the most advanced AI technology`
            `its risk may have a broad and serious effect on human life, physical safety and fundamental rights` IS `its risk may broadly and seriously affect life, safety and rights`

§ `A domestic representative (Article 36), for an operator with no address or office in Korea`

@export Must I designate a domestic representative under Article 36 of Korea's AI Framework Act, and report it to the Minister of Science and ICT? Only an operator with no address or business office in Korea that meets one of Decree Article 29(1)'s criteria must: previous-year revenue of at least 1 trillion won; previous-year AI-service revenue of at least 10 billion won; an average of at least 1,000,000 daily users in Korea over the last three months of the previous year; or a past fine under Article 43(1) item 3. Neither the Act nor the Decree states a period; the answer's period is "nothing stated".
GIVEN `my business is related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you carry on a business related to the AI industry?
      `I develop AI and provide it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop AI and provide it?
      `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you provide AI products or AI services using AI that a developer provided?
      `I have an address or business office in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have an address (주소) or a business office (영업소) in Korea?
      `I act in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct take place in Korea?
      `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct, wherever it takes place, affect the Korean market or users in Korea?
      `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI developed and used only for tasks listed in Decree Article 2 (defence and national security)?
      `my total revenue last year in won` IS A NUMBER @desc Your total revenue in the previous year (for a corporation, the previous business year), in Korean won, converted at that year's average exchange rate.
      `my AI-service revenue last year in won` IS A NUMBER @desc Your revenue from AI services in the previous year (for a corporation, the previous business year), in Korean won, converted at that year's average exchange rate.
      `my average daily users in Korea` IS A NUMBER @desc The average daily number of users in Korea of your AI products and AI services over the three months before the end of the previous year.
      `I have been fined for not carrying out an order under Article 40(3)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you ever been fined under Article 43(1) item 3 (not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3))?
GIVETH A `Domestic representative answer`
`Must I designate a domestic representative` `my business is related to the AI industry` `I develop AI and provide it` `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` `I have an address or business office in Korea` `I act in Korea` `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` `my total revenue last year in won` `my AI-service revenue last year in won` `my average daily users in Korea` `I have been fined for not carrying out an order under Article 40(3)` MEANS
    `Article 36(1): the domestic representative` `me` `my scale`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS `my business is related to the AI industry`
            `develops AI and provides it` IS `I develop AI and provide it`
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI`
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS `I have an address or business office in Korea`
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS `I act in Korea`
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea`
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks`
        `my scale` MEANS `The operator's scale` WITH
            `total revenue in the previous year, in won` IS `my total revenue last year in won`
            `revenue from AI services in the previous year, in won` IS `my AI-service revenue last year in won`
            `average daily users in Korea over the last three months of the previous year` IS `my average daily users in Korea`
            `has been fined under Article 43(1) item 3` IS `I have been fined for not carrying out an order under Article 40(3)`

§ `Telling users that a product or service runs on AI (Article 31(1))`

@export Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI, under Article 31(1) of Korea's AI Framework Act? Required when providing a product or service that uses high-impact AI or generative AI, except where Decree Article 23(4) lets it go: the use of such AI is obvious, or the product is used only internally. Not giving the notice is finable under Article 43(1) item 1.
GIVEN `my business is related to the AI industry` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you carry on a business related to the AI industry?
      `I develop AI and provide it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you develop AI and provide it?
      `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you provide AI products or AI services using AI that a developer provided?
      `I act in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct take place in Korea?
      `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does your conduct, wherever it takes place, affect the Korean market or users in Korea?
      `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the AI developed and used only for tasks listed in Decree Article 2 (defence and national security)?
      `it uses high-impact AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the product or service use high-impact AI (Article 2(4): AI that may significantly affect or endanger life, physical safety or fundamental rights, used in one of the listed areas)?
      `it uses generative AI` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the product or service use generative AI (Article 2(5): AI that imitates the structure and features of input data to generate text, sound, images, video or other output)?
      `the AI use is obvious` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it obvious that high-impact or generative AI is used, from the product or service name, the user's screen, the product's surface, or text shown in the output (Decree Article 23(4) item 1)?
      `it is only for internal use` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the product or service used only for your own internal business (Decree Article 23(4) item 2)?
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Must I tell users in advance that my product or service runs on AI` `my business is related to the AI industry` `I develop AI and provide it` `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI` `I act in Korea` `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks` `it uses high-impact AI` `it uses generative AI` `the AI use is obvious` `it is only for internal use` MEANS
    `Article 31(1): the operator must give users prior notice` `me` `my product`
    WHERE
        `me` MEANS `The operator` WITH
            `carries on a business related to the AI industry` IS `my business is related to the AI industry`
            `develops AI and provides it` IS `I develop AI and provide it`
            `provides AI products or services using AI that a developer provided` IS `I provide AI products or services using a developer's AI`
            `the conduct takes place in Korea` IS `I act in Korea`
            `the conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea` IS `my conduct affects the Korean market or users in Korea`
            `the AI is developed and used only for tasks Decree Article 2 lists` IS `the AI is only for listed defence or security tasks`
            -- Placeholder: Article 31(1) does not read this field.
            `has an address or a business office in Korea` IS FALSE
        `my product` MEANS `The product or service` WITH
            `uses high-impact AI` IS `it uses high-impact AI`
            `uses generative AI` IS `it uses generative AI`
            `that it uses such AI is obvious from its name, screen, surface or output` IS `the AI use is obvious`
            `is used only for the operator's internal business` IS `it is only for internal use`

§ `What the Minister of Science and ICT can do to me, and the fines`

@export Can Korea's Minister of Science and ICT investigate me over a suspected breach of this provision of the AI Framework Act? Article 40(1) lets the Minister require materials or investigate, and Article 40(2) lets officials enter offices, only for suspected or reported breaches of Articles 31(2), 31(3), 32(1), 32(2) and 34(1). This question assumes the Act reaches you and you are an AI business operator (see the first two questions).
GIVEN `the provision` IS A `Duty provision` @desc Which duty do you want to ask about: Article 31(1) (prior notice to users), 31(2) (marking generative output), 31(3) (realistic synthetic output), 32(1) (safety measures), 32(2) (submitting results), 33(1) (reviewing whether AI is high-impact), 34(1) (high-impact measures) or 36(1) (domestic representative)?
GIVETH AN `Investigation answer`
`Can the Minister investigate me over a suspected breach of` `the provision` MEANS
    `Article 40(1): may the Minister investigate a suspected breach of` `the provision`

@export What administrative fine (과태료) can I be given for this failure under Article 43 of Korea's AI Framework Act and Decree Annex 2, in won? Gives the order of the violation, the fine Annex 2 sets, the most the Minister may impose by increasing it by up to one half (never above Article 43(1)'s ceiling of 30,000,000 won), and the least by reducing it by up to one half (no reduction while in arrears with a fine).
GIVEN `the failure` IS A `Finable failure` @desc Which failure: not giving users the prior notice of Article 31(1) (Article 43(1) item 1); not designating a domestic representative under Article 36(1) (item 2); or not carrying out a suspension or corrective order under Article 40(3) (item 3)?
      `my earlier fine order` IS A NUMBER @desc For the same violation, in the two years before this one was detected, what was the order of your highest fine (0 if none, 1 for a first, 2 for a second, 3 for a third or later)?
      `I am in arrears with a fine` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you currently in arrears with an administrative fine (과태료)?
GIVETH A `Fine answer`
`What is the fine for this failure` `the failure` `my earlier fine order` `I am in arrears with a fine` MEANS
    `Annex 2: the fine for the violation` `this violation`
    WHERE
        `this violation` MEANS `The violation` WITH
            `failure` IS `the failure`
            `order of the highest fine for the same violation in the previous two years` IS `my earlier fine order`
            `the operator is in arrears with a fine` IS `I am in arrears with a fine`

@export Can I be fined directly for not carrying out the Article 32 safety measures, or for not submitting their results, under Korea's AI Framework Act? Article 43(1) fines only three failures, and Article 32 is not one; the route to a fine runs through an Article 40 investigation and an order under Article 40(3).
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (the answer does not depend on it).
GIVETH AN `Article 32 fine answer`
`Can I be fined directly for not carrying out Article 32` `the date` MEANS
    `Article 43(1): a failure under Article 32 is not itself finable, on` `the date`

@export Does Korea's AI Framework Act or its Enforcement Decree give me a grace period before I can be investigated or fined? Neither text contains one; a grace period the government has announced, if any, is policy and not law.
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about (the answer does not depend on it).
GIVETH A `Grace period answer`
`Does the law give me a grace period` `the date` MEANS
    `a grace period in law on` `the date`

§ `When the Act applies`

@export Were Korea's AI Framework Act and its Enforcement Decree in force on this date? Both took effect on 22 January 2026 (except the digital-medical-device part of Act Article 2(4)(라) and of Decree Annex 1, from 24 January 2026, which this encoding does not cover).
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE @desc The date you are asking about.
GIVETH A `Commencement`
`Were the Act and the Decree in force` `the date` MEANS
    `the Act and the Decree in force on` `the date`
